 "subject": "How to draw a state map within a country",
 "messages_listed": 3,
 "last_activity": "2014-08-14T02:41:11Z",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "uVH1dgIqhAsJ",
   "from": "Shittu, Aminu",
   "author": "63f04078443444c3",
   "date": "2014-08-13T05:10:34Z",
   "subject": "How to draw a state map within a country",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div><div style=\"color:#000;background-color:#fff;font-family:garamond,new york,times,serif;font-size:14pt\"><div>Dear ggplotters,</div><div><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\">I am interested in drawing a map of a country (Nigeria) and label each state, and then shade one of the states (our study area). Could someone kindly help me on how to do this step-by-step? I am doing this for the first time.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\">Looking forward to hearing from you.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\">Kind regards,</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\">Aminu.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\"><br></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "JU03WjWpAmYJ",
   "from": "Metabolomics",
   "author": "6e448c1012f8f3d2",
   "date": "2014-08-13T20:44:39Z",
   "subject": "Re: How to draw a state map within a country",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Take a look at this:</div><div><br></div><div><div>library(maps)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span># Map functions<br></div><div>library(ggplot2)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span># Required for the map_data() function and other ggplot2 functions</div><div><br></div><div>con &lt;- url(&quot;<a href=\"http://gadm.org/data/rda/NGA_adm1.RData\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://gadm.org/data/rda/NGA_adm1.RData&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370397124000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Wpn3pNs6al4SQqpyIx6iI\">http://gadm.org/data/rda/NGA_adm1.RData</a>&quot;)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span># Get Nigeria map from GADM</div><div>print(load(con))<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span># Load the map</div><div>close (con)</div><div><br></div><div>nigeria.selected_regions &lt;- c(&quot;Adamawa&quot;,<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span># Regions to plot</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> &quot;Akwa Ibom&quot;, &quot;Anambra&quot;, &quot;Bauchi&quot;,</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&quot;Benue&quot;, &quot;Borno&quot;,</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&quot;Delta&quot;, &quot;Edo&quot;,</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&quot;Federal Capital Territory&quot;, &quot;Imo&quot;)</div><div>nigeria_map.ff &lt;- fortify(gadm)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span># Create ggplot compatible data.frame</div><div><br></div><div># Extract polygon corners and merge with shapefile data</div><div>gadm@data$id &lt;- rownames(gadm@data)</div><div>nigeria_map.df &lt;- merge(gadm@data, nigeria_map.ff, by = &quot;id&quot;, all.y = TRUE)</div><div><br></div><div>#Build up the plot</div><div>p1 &lt;- ggplot() + </div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>theme_bw() + theme(panel.border = element_blank(),</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>panel.grid.major = element_blank(),</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>panel.grid.minor = element_blank())</div><div>p2 &lt;- p1 +</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>ggtitle(&quot;GADM Level 0 Map of Nigeria&quot;)</div><div>p2 &lt;- p2 + geom_path(data = nigeria_map.df,</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>aes(x = long, y = lat, group = group))</div><div>p2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span># Plot all regions</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://dev.new\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dev.new&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370397124000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zU9Naw0gGMtzW4M-JAgD2\">dev.new</a>()</div><div>p3 &lt;- p1 + </div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>ggtitle(&quot;GADM Level 1 Map of Nigeria - Selected Regions Highlighted&quot;) +</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>geom_path(data = nigeria_map.df, aes(x = long, y = lat, group = group)) +</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>geom_polygon(data = subset(nigeria_map.df, NAME_1 %in% nigeria.selected_regions),<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>aes(x = long, y = lat, group = group, fill = NAME_1))</div><div>p3<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span># Plot selected regions</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><div><br></div><div><br></div><br>On Wednesday, August 13, 2014 1:10:34 AM UTC-4, Shittu, Aminu wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div style=\"color:#000;background-color:#fff;font-family:garamond,new york,times,serif;font-size:14pt\"><div>Dear ggplotters,</div><div><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\">I am interested in drawing a map of a country (Nigeria) and label each state, and then shade one of the states (our study area). Could someone kindly help me on how to do this step-by-step? I am doing this for the first time.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\">Looking forward to hearing from you.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\">Kind regards,</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\">Aminu.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:19px;font-family:garamond,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent\"><br></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
